%% 08-backgrounds.mgp - learn MagicPoint on gucOS, deck 8 of 10 (todos/0202).
%% %back at page scope, %bgrad gradients, %bimage image backgrounds.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "black", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%tab 2 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Backgrounds

deck 8 of 10: back, bgrad, bimage
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Three choices

	%back "color" - a solid page color
		usually set once, via %default
	%bgrad - a generated gradient
	%bimage "file" - an image as the backdrop
	all three belong at the TOP of a page
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bgrad

\%bgrad, no arguments

%size 4
blue fading to black, top to bottom - the default
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bgrad 0 0 256 90 1 "black" "DarkGreen"

Direction

%size 4
bgrad 0 0 256 90 1 "black" "DarkGreen"
%size 3, fore "gray70"

the fourth argument turns the fade:
0 top-down, 90 left-right, 180 bottom-up
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bgrad 0 0 256 45 1 "MidnightBlue" "orchid" "gold"

Color stops

%size 4
list as many colors as you like:
MidnightBlue, orchid, gold at 45 degrees
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bgrad 25 25 256 0 0 "gray35" "black"

Tiles

%size 4
xsize/ysize under 100 (here 25 25) repeat
the gradient as a tile pattern
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bimage "demo.gif"

\%bimage

%size 4
the image paints the backdrop, text draws over it
%size 3

keep backdrops QUIET - if the text fights the
background, the background wins and you lose
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: 09-builds.mgp
